      <title>Section 52 - Vector Line Integrals</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Calculate a vector line integral along an oriented curve in space.
    </li>
    <li>
      Calculate a vector line integral written in expanded notation.
    </li>
    <li>
      Use properties to compute a vector line integral.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

